:: Home_Bathroom_Alone [nobr]
<<HUD>>

<div class="prose-block">

<p>You lock a door that doesn&apos;t really need locking, in an apartment where you live alone. Habit, not necessity.</p>

<p>It doesn&apos;t take long. It never does when it&apos;s just about function   five minutes of not thinking about rent, or loans, or the DashDrop app, or anything at all, which is honestly the whole appeal. Efficient. Unglamorous. A pressure valve, not an event.</p>

<p>Afterward you feel marginally more human, which is a low bar you clear anyway.</p>

</div>

